OL,4,CUS army warns detonation of unstable   
OL,5,Cexplosives will create toxic plume     
OL,6,GThe US Army is set to detonate five    
OL,7,Gtonnes of degraded explosive material  
OL,8,Gin Middletown, Iowa, and have urged    
OL,9,Glocals to vacate the area or stay      
OL,10,Gindoors for their safety.              
OL,12,FThe detonations will result in an air  
OL,13,Fplume that could send toxic dust,      
OL,14,Fcontaining lead particles, over        
OL,15,Feastern Iowa and into neighbouring     
OL,16,FIllinois, with the potential for       
OL,17,Fcontaminants to settle on farmland,    
OL,18,Fplaygrounds and other surfaces, the    
OL,19,Farmy said.                             
